      "title": "Request query evaluated as JavaScript",
      "description": "The /calc handler passes req.query.expr straight to eval. The added suppression comments hide this from the linters. Any caller of /calc can run arbitrary code inside the server process. The attacker gains full control of the host and its secrets. Remove eval and parse the expression with a restricted arithmetic evaluator. Reject input that holds anything other than digits, operators, parentheses and spaces.",
